pageType: chapter
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$primary"
elements:
  - elementId: ch2-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [100, 240, 300, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "#FFFFFF99"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>PART 02</p>
  - elementId: ch2-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [100, 290, 800, 70]
    content:
      style: "$chapterTitle"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>解决这个问题的难点</strong></p>
  - elementId: ch2-subtitle
    elementType: text
    bounds: [100, 370, 800, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 20
      color: "#FFFFFFCC"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>硬件低语义、PC/指针无上下文、BRAM有限、验证基准易污染</p>
